145
00:10:04,179 --> 00:10:08,831
Despite extensive research and
standardization across international

146
00:10:08,831 --> 00:10:14,456
laboratories, important empirical limits
persist in metal additive manufacturing.

147
00:10:14,456 --> 00:10:19,198
Technical reports from NIST and ASTM
International emphasize that current

148
00:10:19,198 --> 00:10:24,135
in-situ sensing techniques cannot detect
every microscopic defect or predict

149
00:10:24,135 --> 00:10:26,344
