complex structural geometries.

159
00:11:11,299 --> 00:11:17,133
Metal 3D printing is not magic; it is
precise thermal management of materials

160
00:11:17,133 --> 00:11:19,709
science at microsecond timescales.

161
00:11:19,709 --> 00:11:24,285
By controlling laser energy, powder
quality, and thermal cooling gradients,

162
00:11:24,285 --> 00:11:29,227
additive manufacturing turns tiny metal
grains into complex structural parts that

163
00:11:29,227 --> 00:11:31,789
push the boundaries of modern engineering.
